&lt;li&gt;[AppSec] Emit appsec.waf.error telemetry (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5185888130" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9075" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9075/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9075"&gt;#9075&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] Fix entry loss in DefaultTaintedMap under concurrency (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5141210448" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9041" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9041/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9041"&gt;#9041&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
